OL,3,GNEWSACloud-like sculptures installed in
OL,4,Anew public park
OL,5,
OL,6,FA series of cloud-like sculptures have
OL,7,Fbeen unveiled at a site that will
OL,8,Feventually be home to laboratories,
OL,9,Foffices, a park and hundreds of homes.
OL,11,FThe Length of a Moment artworks sit in
OL,12,Fthe new public park at the Oxford North
OL,13,Fdevelopment - best known in the local
OL,14,Farea for the large red-roofed structure
OL,15,Fat its heart.
OL,17,FThe trio of bronze sculptures depict
OL,18,Fthe plume of scent a flower releases
OL,19,Finto the air as a moth searches for its
OL,20,Fnectar.
OL,23,APub: 20-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
