OL,3,GNEWSACloud-like sculptures installed in
OL,4,Anew public park
OL,5,
OL,6,FArtist Alexandra Daisy Ginsberg said
OL,7,Fthe works - which are more than two
OL,8,Fmetres (6.5ft) tall - "celebrate the
OL,9,Fpart every living creature plays in the
OL,10,Fworld we share".
